WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:07.966
[opening theme music playing]

00:35.744 --> 00:37.078
If I do not mind dying,

00:38.038 --> 00:39.873
then can I keep doing
what I have been doing?

00:42.876 --> 00:45.003
I told you that
I'm willing to risk it all,

00:45.962 --> 00:47.756
and that the two of us are
in this together.

00:49.132 --> 00:51.217
I will keep going even if it kills me.

00:51.301 --> 00:52.552
And you should do the same as well.

00:53.470 --> 00:55.764
I think it's better
if you stick to your confession,

00:57.348 --> 00:58.600
and keep loving me to death.

01:13.198 --> 01:15.533
Mu-deok, those eyes,
don't look at me like that.

01:16.034 --> 01:17.577
You told me that you'd love me to death,

01:17.660 --> 01:19.245
but I'm sure
they'll see the lie with those eyes.

01:20.413 --> 01:21.498
Then, young master.

01:21.998 --> 01:26.002
How is a girl who loves a boy to death
supposed to look at him then?

01:27.003 --> 01:28.838
[inhales] Well, first of all…

01:29.589 --> 01:32.467
uh, glaring at me
like that will definitely not do.

01:33.760 --> 01:36.137
They say one's eyes should be
brimming with sweetness. [chuckles]

01:38.556 --> 01:39.766
That's too much, right?

01:40.475 --> 01:42.936
Ugh, why did you even
have to say it in the first place?

01:43.019 --> 01:46.314
If you'd told them you had mild feelings,
it would have been easier.

01:46.397 --> 01:47.232
[scoffs]

01:47.941 --> 01:50.318
Say that I try to
look at you with sweetness,

01:50.401 --> 01:52.529
and keep loving you to death.

01:52.612 --> 01:54.697
What will become of Mu-deok from now on?

01:54.781 --> 01:56.074
From now on?

01:56.157 --> 01:59.035
Wow. So you want me to
carry on without a plan

01:59.119 --> 02:01.913
when Maidservant Kim is trying
so hard to marry you off?

02:03.623 --> 02:06.042
What do you think
will happen to Mu-deok, then?

02:06.835 --> 02:10.004
Oh, do not worry, your young master won't
get married just yet.

02:10.088 --> 02:11.297
"Not just yet"?

02:11.840 --> 02:13.258
You didn't want to drink
the chaste herb tea

02:13.341 --> 02:14.425
so you could get married.

02:17.137 --> 02:20.223
So, Mu-deok, are you telling me…

02:20.306 --> 02:23.309
you want some kind of a promise
of a future for us or something?

02:23.393 --> 02:25.186
If I am to keep on loving you,

02:26.437 --> 02:28.815
of course, I need to be certain
that you are mine.

02:31.067 --> 02:35.029
Do you not think this is something
that should be decided so hastily?

02:35.113 --> 02:36.030
So you're refusing?

02:37.949 --> 02:40.827
I mean, why do you always
have to be so… dramatic?

02:40.910 --> 02:43.454
I'm just saying
I cannot do it right now, right here.

02:43.538 --> 02:46.541
Maidservant Kim… I need to
talk to Maidservant Kim first, too.

02:46.624 --> 02:48.459
[scoffs] Unbelievable.

02:48.543 --> 02:49.377
Forget it!

02:50.461 --> 02:52.172
"Eyes brimming with sweetness,"
yeah, right.

02:52.255 --> 02:54.841
I'll look at you like a dog
barking up the wrong tree.

02:54.924 --> 02:56.009
A dog?

02:57.010 --> 02:57.969
Oh, right. Dog!

02:58.052 --> 02:59.679
I've been forgetting
about something important.

02:59.762 --> 03:01.514
Master, this isn't the time to argue.

03:02.140 --> 03:03.933
The dog that time was the dog.

03:04.517 --> 03:06.060
What nonsense are you barking about?

03:06.144 --> 03:08.980
The dog Master Lee had back there
in Danhyanggok. Do you remember?

03:10.148 --> 03:11.232
That Sapsali?

03:11.316 --> 03:12.650
Yes, that dog…

03:13.860 --> 03:15.028
was Gwigu.

03:18.072 --> 03:19.616
Master Lee has always known

03:20.241 --> 03:22.243
that you're actually a soul shifter
from the beginning.

03:22.744 --> 03:23.661
He might…

03:24.829 --> 03:26.623
even know that you are Naksu.

03:27.123 --> 03:29.125
[brooding music playing]

03:40.178 --> 03:43.765
[Jin] What brings Jinyowon's leader
to Songrim at this time of the day?

03:49.270 --> 03:50.980
I guess she must be here for you.

03:51.981 --> 03:53.107
[Ho-gyeong] I heard

03:53.191 --> 03:56.653
that you took our relic, Gwigu,
into the royal palace today.

03:56.736 --> 03:59.530
It was to find traces
of sorcery in the royal palace.

03:59.614 --> 04:04.118
I warned you not to involve Jinyowon
in any cases related to the soul shifters.

04:04.202 --> 04:06.371
Why is Songrim using Jinyowon at will?

04:08.665 --> 04:10.583
The mage families
of the Unanimous Assembly

04:10.667 --> 04:12.335
must strive to stop sorcery.

04:12.418 --> 04:16.214
If Songrim is striving to do just that,
it's obvious for Jinyowon to offer

04:16.881 --> 04:18.466
their assistance, is it not?

04:18.549 --> 04:22.136
What is obvious is that
you intend to use us again.

04:22.220 --> 04:25.098
In that case, I will take Gwigu with me.

04:26.349 --> 04:28.226
[Ho-gyeong]
Don't make a fuss and hand over Gwigu.

04:28.309 --> 04:31.980
Or should I try to look for it myself?

04:32.689 --> 04:34.190
[Master Lee] Gwigu is right here.

04:34.274 --> 04:35.108
[Gwigu barking]

04:44.617 --> 04:47.829
Gwigu is a precious relic
created by Master Seo Gyeong.

04:47.912 --> 04:49.497
So, it also belongs to Songrim.

04:49.580 --> 04:51.874
You dare suggest that our relic
belongs to Songrim?

04:51.958 --> 04:55.586
Are you saying that Jinyowon is just
some kind of storehouse for others?

04:55.670 --> 04:57.422
That is not what he meant at all.

04:57.505 --> 04:58.715
So that's why you're so shameless.

04:58.798 --> 05:01.342
Because you think
everything in Jinyowon is Songrim's.

05:01.426 --> 05:03.553
It seems that Songrim mages

05:04.137 --> 05:05.930
love to just take things without asking.

05:08.433 --> 05:12.061
You have said
something similar before as well.

05:13.771 --> 05:17.984
That there was a Songrim mage
who had taken something from Jinyowon.

05:18.067 --> 05:20.069
[tense music playing]

05:25.491 --> 05:26.951
Who was that person?

05:38.129 --> 05:40.923
Over there. I'm looking right at him.

05:41.966 --> 05:44.594
The man who snuck into
Jinyowon like a thief

05:44.677 --> 05:46.345
and stole Gwigu from us.

05:47.430 --> 05:51.225
How dare you!
You dare call Master Lee a thief!

05:51.309 --> 05:52.810
If taking what belongs to others

05:52.894 --> 05:55.271
without permission is not thievery,
then what is?

05:55.354 --> 05:57.690
Mother, please, calm yourself.

05:57.774 --> 06:01.861
[Heo Yeom] But the person who moved it
from the broken pottery into the body

06:01.944 --> 06:03.654
- of that dog was Master Lee.
- [Gwigu growls]

06:03.738 --> 06:05.573
It was Songrim that broke it.

06:05.656 --> 06:06.824
- [Heo Yeom] How dare you!
- [growls]

06:09.410 --> 06:10.870
[barks, growls]

06:18.878 --> 06:20.546
[loud rumbling]

06:25.676 --> 06:28.596
[growls]

06:28.679 --> 06:30.681
[tense music playing]

06:36.020 --> 06:37.105
[gasps]

06:55.123 --> 06:56.374
[breathes heavily]

07:08.553 --> 07:10.263
It is dead, master.

07:11.389 --> 07:12.390
[Heo Yeom sighs]

07:14.267 --> 07:15.726
I was protecting my daughter.

07:15.810 --> 07:19.188
Master Lee, did you give Gwigu
an order to attack us just now?

07:19.272 --> 07:21.858
Gwigu attacked because it sensed sorcery.

07:26.028 --> 07:27.321
So, that means she…

07:29.157 --> 07:31.117
has traces of sorcery.

07:31.200 --> 07:33.202
[suspenseful music playing]

07:39.292 --> 07:42.628
[U-tak] It must have sensed the sorcery
of the worm that sucked her blood.

07:48.968 --> 07:50.052
Young Lady Jin.

07:51.137 --> 07:52.138
Have you…

07:52.930 --> 07:54.599
ever performed sorcery?

08:00.813 --> 08:03.024
Did you say sorcery?
That is complete nonsense!

08:03.107 --> 08:06.777
Then, why would Gwigu try to attack her?

08:07.361 --> 08:10.406
Songrim must be trying
to frame my daughter right now.

08:10.490 --> 08:11.991
[Cho-yeon] Everyone, please, stop!

08:12.658 --> 08:14.410
Master Lee is absolutely right.

08:17.997 --> 08:19.207
The truth is…

08:19.999 --> 08:23.544
not too long ago, I did use sorcery.

08:25.671 --> 08:26.547
[Heo Yeom] Huh.

08:29.634 --> 08:33.262
But it wasn't anything
malicious to hurt anyone.

08:37.600 --> 08:38.893
[paper rustles]

08:41.562 --> 08:43.606
It's quite popular these days.

08:45.066 --> 08:48.569
[Cho-yeon] It's a Lovers' Charm
that helps one's love.

08:54.617 --> 08:56.536
I think it may have been because of this.

08:56.619 --> 08:57.828
[exhales]

08:59.372 --> 09:01.332
- [inhales]
- [breathes shakily]

09:04.043 --> 09:07.129
[U-tak] It seems our daughter has caused
a misunderstanding.

09:07.213 --> 09:08.297
Our apologies.

09:22.103 --> 09:24.105
[somber music playing]

09:32.071 --> 09:35.866
You stayed alive
in the body of this once-dead dog,

09:36.784 --> 09:38.828
but now all your energy is gone.

09:47.253 --> 09:50.673
Gwigu… has now completely vanished.

09:52.675 --> 09:54.010
[Cho-yeon] What do we do?

09:54.844 --> 09:58.556
So, is it all my fault that Gwigu died?

09:58.639 --> 09:59.515
Jin Cho-yeon!

10:00.266 --> 10:02.643
How dare you disgrace Jinyowon?

10:02.727 --> 10:03.561
[gasps]

10:07.356 --> 10:09.525
[soft music playing]

10:27.126 --> 10:28.336
[Jang Uk] Gwigu is dead?

10:29.503 --> 10:30.546
[Seo Yul] Yes.

10:30.630 --> 10:33.466
Master Lee said he will bury it
in the daylight tomorrow.

10:34.967 --> 10:36.719
[Mu-deok] So this dog was Gwigu.

10:37.428 --> 10:39.639
[Gwigu growling]

10:40.264 --> 10:43.809
It must have known that I was
a soul shifter from the moment it saw me.

10:43.893 --> 10:45.978
But it never barked at me after that.

10:47.730 --> 10:50.316
Was it covering for me, too?

10:55.237 --> 10:56.864
Even though it is dead, it is still Gwigu.

10:57.865 --> 11:00.576
It's dangerous if its power remains.
Do not touch it.

11:08.876 --> 11:11.337
The people from Jinyowon,
did they just leave?

11:11.420 --> 11:13.047
They are discussing
another issue right now.

11:13.756 --> 11:14.632
Another issue?

11:15.257 --> 11:16.801
It turns out Dang-gu and Cho-yeon

11:17.885 --> 11:19.095
were in a relationship.

11:20.429 --> 11:21.263
- What?
- What?

11:22.640 --> 11:25.935
I was the one who destroyed
a relic of Jinyowon,

11:26.018 --> 11:27.895
so no harm was done to Songrim.

11:28.479 --> 11:30.398
[Ho-gyeong]
Now that we are done, we shall get going.

11:31.524 --> 11:32.650
Let's go.

11:32.733 --> 11:34.985
- Yes.
- [Heo Yeom] Uh, Wait, Lady Jin.

11:35.069 --> 11:37.321
At least, have some tea before you leave.

11:37.405 --> 11:40.699
We should clear misunderstandings
and make meaningful bonds.

11:40.783 --> 11:41.951
Make bonds?

11:42.034 --> 11:43.994
[Heo Yeom] These two are in love,
are they not?

11:44.078 --> 11:46.455
The charm that you took out before

11:46.539 --> 11:49.166
was for your relationship
with Dang-gu, was it not?

11:51.544 --> 11:53.796
Right. It's all because of me.

11:54.380 --> 11:56.132
Cho-yeon hasn't done anything wrong.

11:56.215 --> 11:57.216
Don't get involved.

11:59.927 --> 12:01.554
I, too, learned of this recently.

12:01.637 --> 12:03.431
He was talking nonsense about how

12:03.514 --> 12:05.808
they could be together
if your late daughter returns,

12:06.350 --> 12:08.102
so I made sure
to reprimand him personally.

12:08.185 --> 12:11.230
My late daughter? Bu-yeon is alive
and we will find her soon.

12:12.690 --> 12:15.317
Do you truly believe
that Jin Mu will find Bu-yeon?

12:15.943 --> 12:18.821
He is undoubtedly playing you
for a fool right now, Lady Jin.

12:19.405 --> 12:21.782
Was it also Jin Mu
who gave you the idea to search

12:21.866 --> 12:23.701
Songrim for Gwigu at this hour?

12:23.784 --> 12:25.995
Please, don't meddle
in Jinyowon's affairs.

12:26.579 --> 12:29.415
[sighs] Now, let us not fight. All right?

12:29.498 --> 12:32.626
Will it not be wonderful news
if Lady Jin finds her daughter?

12:32.710 --> 12:37.381
And Lady Jin, what good can come out
of making enemies with Songrim? Huh?

12:37.465 --> 12:40.801
Be cordial as we were like before.

12:40.885 --> 12:42.303
Who knows, hmm?

12:42.386 --> 12:46.015
Cho-yeon and Dang-gu may unite
the two families together.

12:46.098 --> 12:47.433
I may have to decline.

12:47.516 --> 12:50.227
Cho-yeon will definitely have
a better suitor.

12:51.729 --> 12:55.649
Come now. Who is better than
the Park family of Songrim? Gosh!

12:55.733 --> 12:57.276
A daughter of my family

12:57.359 --> 13:00.112
is good enough to be
the bride of the Crown Prince.

13:01.655 --> 13:04.283
Mother, what are you
talking about right now?

13:05.242 --> 13:06.452
I do not want to.

13:07.244 --> 13:08.913
The Crown Prince is unkind.

13:09.413 --> 13:11.874
- I don't like him at all.
- Jin Cho-yeon.

13:12.625 --> 13:14.502
I'm going to get married
to someone I love.

13:14.585 --> 13:15.461
[gasps]

13:16.045 --> 13:16.879
[Dang-gu] Yes.

13:17.505 --> 13:19.423
And I am that someone she loves.

13:19.507 --> 13:20.549
Park Dang-gu!

13:26.472 --> 13:28.224
We will talk about this at home.

13:31.018 --> 13:32.728
Let go of his hand this instant.

13:34.813 --> 13:36.524
[Jin] Let her go for now.

13:36.607 --> 13:38.442
Put down her hand and let her go.

13:38.526 --> 13:39.652
[exclaims]

13:39.735 --> 13:41.278
Let go of that hand.

13:41.362 --> 13:42.446
Let go!

13:51.622 --> 13:52.581
[Ho-gyeong] Cho-yeon.

13:52.665 --> 13:55.584
If you are going to do what you wish,
do not even bother coming home.

13:59.255 --> 14:00.089
[U-tak] Uh…

14:01.632 --> 14:02.591
- [sighs]
- [door opens]

14:04.635 --> 14:07.555
I think it will be better
that we leave for now.

14:08.138 --> 14:08.973
[Heo Yeom] Mm.

14:10.349 --> 14:11.892
Will you really not come with us?

14:11.976 --> 14:14.228
I will not do what Mother wants this time.

14:15.771 --> 14:17.231
Please, understand me.

14:18.232 --> 14:19.066
[sighs]

14:19.692 --> 14:22.403
Once your mother has calmed down,
I will send word.

14:24.697 --> 14:25.990
Please take care of her for now.

14:26.824 --> 14:27.658
I will.

14:37.167 --> 14:39.879
Sorry, Uncle, I apologize for the trouble.

14:39.962 --> 14:41.547
But I have to protect my lady.

14:41.630 --> 14:43.632
- You get out now!
- [exclaims]

14:51.807 --> 14:52.641
[Cho-yeon clears throat]

14:52.725 --> 14:55.519
Where should we stay tonight, Dang-gu?

14:57.980 --> 14:59.148
[Dang-gu] I don't know.

15:02.735 --> 15:06.697
Since he told us to leave, I suppose,
for now, we could go to an inn

15:06.780 --> 15:07.698
- and get a room--
- [gasps]

15:08.407 --> 15:10.242
- Get a room, you said?
- Sorry?

15:10.326 --> 15:11.827
[exasperated sigh]

15:11.911 --> 15:13.787
Oh! No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

15:13.871 --> 15:15.998
Not one room, but separate rooms.

15:19.960 --> 15:22.338
I really don't want to stay
in such a place.

15:24.089 --> 15:27.009
But there's nowhere else
we can go at this time of night.

15:27.092 --> 15:28.594
And it's getting cold…

15:29.345 --> 15:30.346
It's cold.

15:32.890 --> 15:34.183
Where can we go?

15:34.266 --> 15:35.392
[maid Kim] Young Master Park!

15:37.061 --> 15:40.397
They said Young Master Jang just got out,
but he's not in his room.

15:40.481 --> 15:41.649
Have you seen him around?

15:42.441 --> 15:44.443
[whimsical music playing]

15:46.737 --> 15:48.739
Is there something wrong with you two?

15:50.574 --> 15:51.784
Oh. Goodness.

15:51.867 --> 15:53.953
- [stutters, softly] Maidservant Kim…
- What…

15:54.036 --> 15:55.037
Maidservant Kim.

15:55.120 --> 15:56.830
You're scaring me.

15:57.790 --> 16:00.334
Gosh, even you, Young Lady Jin?
[stutters] What is going on?

16:00.417 --> 16:02.044
Maidservant Kim…

16:02.127 --> 16:04.588
The relic Gwigu,
which caused mayhem at the palace,

16:04.672 --> 16:08.384
was destroyed by Lady Jin
as she was trying to retrieve it.

16:08.467 --> 16:10.219
Gwigu was really destroyed?

16:10.302 --> 16:12.179
How could she destroy
a treasure that detects sorcery?

16:12.262 --> 16:14.640
Detecting sorcery is just an excuse.

16:14.723 --> 16:18.268
It was a relic that Songrim used
to threaten the royal family.

16:18.352 --> 16:19.895
[Queen] Jin Mu is right.

16:19.979 --> 16:23.524
Songrim wanted to prove they were
more powerful than the royal family.

16:24.817 --> 16:26.694
By pretending to root out sorcery,

16:26.777 --> 16:28.696
they can sway the Unanimous Assembly

16:29.363 --> 16:31.323
to possibly dethrone the king.

16:32.032 --> 16:34.284
Is that why they mentioned
the King's Star?

16:34.368 --> 16:37.413
To threaten me by saying
a new king could potentially emerge?

16:38.706 --> 16:41.208
The reason Master Lee mentioned
the King's Star was to explain

16:41.291 --> 16:42.668
somebody like Master Seo Gyeong

16:42.751 --> 16:44.837
will eventually come and save
the people from the chaos.

16:44.920 --> 16:46.797
It was not to threaten the royal family.

16:46.880 --> 16:50.175
If the one that saves the world
wants to rule it as the next king,

16:51.051 --> 16:52.428
do you think you can stop that?

16:54.013 --> 16:55.597
Gwanju Jang Gang

16:55.681 --> 16:57.975
prophesied that
the King's Star would appear.

16:58.058 --> 16:59.476
[Sun] Master Lee said that as well.

17:00.978 --> 17:03.856
Does Songrim know
about this prophecy, too?

17:03.939 --> 17:04.940
[breathes deeply]

17:11.321 --> 17:14.199
He tried to bear a son
with the energy of the King's Star

17:14.283 --> 17:15.909
from his many concubines.

17:15.993 --> 17:18.579
And now my father is even trying
to find one at Songrim.

17:19.288 --> 17:21.582
It's only natural
for the King to be afraid.

17:22.750 --> 17:24.251
In the eyes of the royal family,

17:24.334 --> 17:27.463
the existence of a King's Star
could be considered treason.

17:33.010 --> 17:33.844
[exhales deeply]

17:34.678 --> 17:35.679
"Treason"?

17:36.889 --> 17:39.433
The people of Daeho do worship
and believe in the heavens,

17:40.059 --> 17:42.770
but the centuries-old monarchy
will not crumble so easily.

17:42.853 --> 17:45.522
It is preposterous to think
that one can become king

17:45.606 --> 17:46.940
for some constellation.

17:47.024 --> 17:49.735
If that person is from Songrim,
it is possible.

17:50.903 --> 17:53.864
Master Seo Gyeong of Songrim
saved the world a long time ago.

17:54.490 --> 17:58.744
But he is still very much
revered within Daeho.

18:00.204 --> 18:02.873
If someone was born under the King's Star
like Master Seo Gyeong,

18:02.956 --> 18:07.628
it could serve as a very convincing reason
to become the King.

18:09.505 --> 18:10.756
So you really think

18:11.965 --> 18:15.094
the King's fears may come true then?

18:16.720 --> 18:17.554
[chuckles softly]

18:17.638 --> 18:19.056
Do not be concerned.

18:19.932 --> 18:24.561
As long as I'm protecting the palace,
the royal family will be fine.

18:27.523 --> 18:28.440
[sighs]

18:29.483 --> 18:30.567
Very well.

18:30.651 --> 18:35.072
I will not be foolish like my father
and live my whole life in constant fear.

18:39.618 --> 18:41.620
When I brought Gwigu to the palace,

18:42.663 --> 18:44.581
I saw as you predicted,

18:44.665 --> 18:47.918
that the Queen is someone who uses sorcery
and one of Jin Mu's people.

18:48.001 --> 18:51.964
But we can't provoke
the royal family just yet.

18:52.047 --> 18:54.383
If Songrim tries
to go after the royal family,

18:54.466 --> 18:57.511
Jin Mu will use
the circumstances of Uk's birth

18:57.594 --> 18:59.972
and turn him into
the enemy of the royal family.

19:00.722 --> 19:04.184
Then Songrim will become
an enemy of the royal family as well

19:04.268 --> 19:05.352
for taking him in.

19:06.311 --> 19:07.771
Jang Gang must come.

19:09.106 --> 19:11.525
Since Jang Gang actually knows
the whole truth,

19:12.151 --> 19:14.570
he must know Jin Mu's weakness as well.

19:14.653 --> 19:17.698
How will you find someone
who has been wandering aimlessly

19:17.781 --> 19:19.032
for decades?

19:19.658 --> 19:21.827
We'll have to hope
he will return on his own.

19:23.162 --> 19:27.082
[Jin] The rumors about soul shifters
have spread throughout Daeho Fortress.

19:27.166 --> 19:30.252
If he hears those rumors,
surely he'll return,

19:30.335 --> 19:35.174
in fear for Songrim and for his son,
Jang Uk, who was left here.

19:40.137 --> 19:42.264
[dramatic music playing]

20:10.709 --> 20:11.793
[chuckles]

20:12.502 --> 20:13.337
[scoffs]

20:13.921 --> 20:15.631
[Jang Uk] I came because I was summoned.

20:15.714 --> 20:16.840
Where is Master Lee?

20:17.341 --> 20:18.675
[exhales, clicks tongue]

20:19.176 --> 20:21.261
He left for Danhyanggok at dawn

20:21.887 --> 20:23.347
and went to bury Sapsali.

20:23.931 --> 20:24.848
What?

20:25.432 --> 20:28.393
He is not here? Was it not Master Lee
who summoned me?

20:28.477 --> 20:29.478
He did summon you.

20:31.688 --> 20:33.482
He told me to give you this.

20:36.193 --> 20:40.447
This is the assassin Naksu's sword
that he retrieved from the Crown Prince.

20:41.615 --> 20:44.117
He said you are the only one
who can keep this sword

20:44.201 --> 20:45.452
and told me to give it to you.

20:46.954 --> 20:48.455
He just left me this sword?

20:48.538 --> 20:51.083
Did he-- did he say
anything else before leaving?

20:51.166 --> 20:55.087
He did not. I do not understand
what makes him so fond of you

20:55.170 --> 20:58.298
when he has no intention
to take you in as his pupil.

20:58.382 --> 21:01.551
From what I can see,
you will not even practice chastity.

21:02.886 --> 21:06.223
I heard from Park Jin that
you are head over heels for a woman.

21:06.848 --> 21:08.558
If you were in love with Mu-deok,

21:08.642 --> 21:10.394
why did you lead on my Yun-ok?

21:11.895 --> 21:14.273
- I swear that I never led her on.
- [Heo Yeom] What nonsense!

21:14.356 --> 21:15.691
You charmed Yun-ok.

21:15.774 --> 21:18.652
And how did you manage
to charm my Master Lee?

21:18.735 --> 21:19.987
I did not do anything.

21:20.070 --> 21:23.573
Accusing me of charming people like that,
just because they are being nice to me…

21:23.657 --> 21:25.784
Master Heo, I think that's unfair of you.

21:27.077 --> 21:30.122
You need to be careful
with Yun-ok's feelings

21:30.205 --> 21:31.832
and be respectful to Master Lee.

21:31.915 --> 21:32.916
Yes.

21:33.000 --> 21:36.628
Master Lee is not as close-minded
as all the other masters at Songrim.

21:36.712 --> 21:39.881
And he seems to be
open-minded and quite gracious.

21:39.965 --> 21:41.383
I certainly do have
a lot of respect for him.

21:41.466 --> 21:42.301
[Heo Yeom scoffs]

21:42.384 --> 21:46.346
I can see you have no idea
how strict he can be, hmm?

21:46.430 --> 21:50.600
He knows how to be merciless towards those
who stray away from the right path.

21:50.684 --> 21:53.437
So you must learn to be careful.

21:53.520 --> 21:54.354
Go ahead.

22:01.111 --> 22:02.779
Oh, I forgot.

22:02.863 --> 22:04.448
I almost screwed up.

22:04.531 --> 22:09.202
There was a message he wanted me
to pass on as he gave Naksu's sword to me.

22:21.256 --> 22:23.175
Why would Master Lee give you my sword?

22:23.884 --> 22:25.969
He probably wants me
to hold on to your sword

22:26.845 --> 22:28.680
since I have you, Naksu, by my side.

22:29.598 --> 22:32.225
I guess that means he'll continue
to leave us alone as always.

22:32.726 --> 22:33.560
That is good.

22:39.524 --> 22:42.152
[Heo Yeom] There was a message
he wanted me to pass on.

22:47.115 --> 22:49.493
Tell him that he must keep the sword safe.

22:49.576 --> 22:52.079
And then if anyone ever tries
to use the sword,

22:52.162 --> 22:53.455
he must kill them at once.

22:55.582 --> 22:57.709
If he fails to follow through…

22:59.669 --> 23:01.505
then he is going to die as well.

23:04.716 --> 23:05.675
[Jang Uk] It was a warning

23:06.259 --> 23:09.179
that he will not let us live
if Mu-deok ever uses that sword

23:09.679 --> 23:11.014
as the assassin Naksu.

23:15.560 --> 23:17.729
The sword feels strange,
even though it's mine.

23:19.022 --> 23:21.608
He must have let me live
because he knows I can't use it.

23:22.692 --> 23:25.195
It means you will be safe
if you stay as Mu-deok.

23:26.071 --> 23:28.365
It means if I become Naksu,
I'll be in danger.

23:29.407 --> 23:31.701
Once I find the ice stone
and regain my power,

23:32.369 --> 23:34.329
I will also gain a lot of enemies again.

23:36.331 --> 23:37.833
What happens to me then

23:38.458 --> 23:39.960
will have nothing to do with you.

23:40.043 --> 23:40.877
Why?

23:41.711 --> 23:43.880
Because we'll no longer be
master and pupil?

23:43.964 --> 23:45.757
You'll no longer have to protect me.

23:46.383 --> 23:48.468
Nor will I have a reason
to go easy on you.

23:49.928 --> 23:52.139
Because that was our promise
from the very beginning.

23:59.980 --> 24:01.356
Then promise me one more thing.

24:02.107 --> 24:04.317
With all the duty and loyalty
that we have built up,

24:04.401 --> 24:07.070
and now as two people
who love each other to death,

24:07.154 --> 24:08.530
you can grant me one more wish, right?

24:10.073 --> 24:11.867
Fine. What is it?

24:12.576 --> 24:13.952
When you regain your energy,

24:14.744 --> 24:17.247
if you must draw that sword
and point it at someone,

24:18.373 --> 24:20.125
point it at me before anyone else.

24:23.170 --> 24:24.087
You stab me,

24:24.838 --> 24:27.382
and I'll take responsibility
for setting Naksu upon the world,

24:28.216 --> 24:29.217
and I will die.

24:33.388 --> 24:34.514
If you don't,

24:35.640 --> 24:37.767
well, at that time,
I'll make you another promise.

24:39.519 --> 24:40.645
The assurances

24:41.479 --> 24:43.398
that you really wanted to hear
from your young master

24:43.481 --> 24:45.775
about our future, you know.

24:54.326 --> 24:57.495
For now, I will look for the ice stone
so you do not run wild…

24:58.955 --> 25:00.540
because I promised you that as well.

25:01.958 --> 25:03.960
[soft music playing]

25:11.718 --> 25:13.303
The runaway couple, my lord,

25:14.471 --> 25:15.931
is staying at our house right now.

25:17.766 --> 25:20.018
Dang-gu is there with Cho-yeon?

25:21.102 --> 25:21.978
Mm.

25:22.562 --> 25:26.691
Why did you take them in, Maid Kim?

25:26.775 --> 25:27.943
Well, then,

25:28.026 --> 25:29.861
should I have left them to go into town

25:29.945 --> 25:33.365
to build a lover's nest
and become the talk of the town?

25:35.325 --> 25:36.618
- Hmm.
- I ask you

25:36.701 --> 25:39.788
to keep an eye on them
and take care of them.

25:39.871 --> 25:42.290
They're a sweet couple.
And those two look good together.

25:42.374 --> 25:44.125
Why are you so against it?

25:44.209 --> 25:46.461
The two of them can't be together.

25:46.544 --> 25:48.338
So you're gonna
kick them out just like that?

25:48.922 --> 25:51.424
My lord, you must stop this right now.

25:51.967 --> 25:55.345
The other night, too, you held Mu-deok
and Young Master Jang for no reason.

25:55.428 --> 25:57.639
You must become
more tolerant as you get older.

25:58.223 --> 26:00.183
Goodness me. [clicks tongue]

26:01.226 --> 26:03.311
[Jang Uk] I like Mu-deok a lot.

26:03.395 --> 26:05.772
[Mu-deok] I truly like Young Master Jang.

26:07.232 --> 26:08.149
Maid Kim.

26:08.900 --> 26:11.361
What would you do if Uk falls in love

26:12.737 --> 26:15.532
with a woman he should not be with,

26:16.199 --> 26:17.158
like Dang-gu?

26:17.242 --> 26:19.244
Could you really be tolerant?

26:20.912 --> 26:21.913
Hmm…

26:23.790 --> 26:27.335
As long as Young Master Jang loves her,
I am not against it.

26:27.419 --> 26:29.170
- Are you sure?
- Of course.

26:32.090 --> 26:33.133
I'm sure you will.

26:33.758 --> 26:35.844
I know that you care about their family,

26:35.927 --> 26:38.888
their appearance, their age,
and everything like that.

26:38.972 --> 26:40.557
The most important is
what the heart wants.

26:41.141 --> 26:44.060
If you are in love,
appearances do not matter at all.

26:44.936 --> 26:46.688
Even if she's not that beautiful,

26:47.272 --> 26:49.649
or they do have
a really big difference in age.

26:50.734 --> 26:51.568
Hmm.

26:55.989 --> 26:59.284
Is that how you feel right now, too?

27:00.744 --> 27:01.619
Maid Kim?

27:01.703 --> 27:02.871
Pardon?

27:06.249 --> 27:09.711
So, anyone who isn't
as handsome as Jang Gang

27:10.712 --> 27:12.255
and is much older

27:12.339 --> 27:15.550
would still have a chance…

27:17.344 --> 27:18.720
if your heart is moved?

27:20.472 --> 27:21.306
Well…

27:22.349 --> 27:23.183
Hmm…

27:25.018 --> 27:26.394
If my heart is moved…

27:28.313 --> 27:31.149
he'd be more handsome
and seem younger to me.

27:31.232 --> 27:32.525
Something like that.

27:35.195 --> 27:38.031
[laughs]

27:45.622 --> 27:48.041
I understand what you mean by that…

27:49.542 --> 27:50.585
Maidservant Kim.

27:52.253 --> 27:53.755
[whimsical music playing]

27:57.008 --> 27:57.842
[exhales]

27:59.636 --> 28:00.762
Ooh.

28:08.311 --> 28:13.191
Goodness gracious! How could he be
so bold in asking my true feelings?

28:13.274 --> 28:14.609
[inhales deeply]

28:14.692 --> 28:16.403
Why is he saying not handsome?

28:16.903 --> 28:18.905
He's only two years older than me.

28:18.988 --> 28:19.864
[chuckles]

28:22.075 --> 28:23.660
He worries for no reason.

28:24.369 --> 28:25.453
[chuckles]

28:27.914 --> 28:29.290
Hmm.

28:34.421 --> 28:38.550
How can Maid Kim say
that she likes Master Lee

28:38.633 --> 28:40.635
so easily in front of me?

28:44.431 --> 28:46.141
Is he really that handsome?

28:48.101 --> 28:51.646
He's more than a hundred years older, too.

28:59.237 --> 29:01.239
[whimsical music playing]

29:01.948 --> 29:02.991
Park Dang-gu.

29:03.783 --> 29:05.368
You little brat!

29:09.497 --> 29:10.790
In times like these,

29:12.208 --> 29:15.962
I wish I could have some of the wine
Uncle always tries to hide in his cabinet…

29:17.130 --> 29:18.381
instead of tea.

29:18.465 --> 29:20.925
What? You already have regrets?

29:21.509 --> 29:22.552
Not at all.

29:23.219 --> 29:26.556
I believed in my heart
that I could really give up everything.

29:26.639 --> 29:29.309
That's the reason
why I took her hand that day.

29:31.644 --> 29:34.939
[Cho-yeon] I didn't know he would
grab my hand so suddenly like that.

29:35.690 --> 29:38.610
I was just upset that
they talked about the Crown Prince.

29:38.693 --> 29:40.695
Then I just said that I don't like him.

29:41.738 --> 29:44.115
But then he grabbed my hand
and said he loved me.

29:44.199 --> 29:45.450
Please, move over a bit.

29:47.452 --> 29:48.411
[Cho-yeon sighs]

29:48.495 --> 29:50.663
I couldn't just let go of his hand.

29:50.747 --> 29:52.832
I mean I was simply
swept up in the moment.

29:53.750 --> 29:56.419
I never thought of
running away with him like this.

29:56.503 --> 29:57.337
[sighs]

29:58.087 --> 29:59.714
How long will you be here for?

30:01.257 --> 30:03.760
Maidservant Kim told me
to serve you two while you are here.

30:04.552 --> 30:05.929
- [sighs]
- [utensils clank]

30:06.012 --> 30:07.472
I don't know.

30:07.555 --> 30:09.641
I don't want to stay here for that long.

30:10.683 --> 30:13.812
We are here like this,
but if I say we should go back home,

30:13.895 --> 30:16.064
I would seem like
a very irresponsible man, right?

30:16.147 --> 30:19.067
If I say I want to go home,
would it break his heart?

30:19.150 --> 30:20.026
[both sigh]

30:20.109 --> 30:21.778
[both] What do I do?

30:23.488 --> 30:24.656
This is for the best.

30:25.156 --> 30:27.200
Serving Young Lady Cho-yeon here

30:27.283 --> 30:29.661
is better than
running into Park Jin at Songrim.

30:29.744 --> 30:31.496
If So-i is the one responsible

30:32.038 --> 30:34.290
for the recent murder
that you are being suspected of,

30:34.874 --> 30:36.000
it's dangerous.

30:36.084 --> 30:39.796
Because you do not know her,
but she does know Mu-deok.

30:41.714 --> 30:44.676
Why is that girl, So-i,
going around killing people?

30:48.555 --> 30:50.723
If the blind girl
who these men were picking on

30:50.807 --> 30:52.642
is the same girl as So-i,

30:53.184 --> 30:54.936
then she couldn't
have killed them herself.

30:55.019 --> 30:56.521
Someone must have helped her.

30:56.604 --> 30:59.816
If the authorities take these bodies,
they will catch the culprit.

31:00.650 --> 31:02.277
Mu-deok would know about So-i.

31:02.360 --> 31:04.612
We should send her to the authorities
and have her questioned.

31:05.822 --> 31:07.532
[Seo Yul] There's no way
she will recognize So-i,

31:07.615 --> 31:10.076
because she's not the Mu-deok
who lived in Sari Village.

31:10.159 --> 31:13.079
She was falsely accused
and has already suffered with this matter.

31:13.162 --> 31:16.040
If necessary, I will go
and ask her for myself.

31:21.921 --> 31:23.047
Hmm.

31:23.131 --> 31:26.384
I don't think you need to step up.
Yul seems already to be on top of it.

31:33.808 --> 31:35.476
[Yeom-su] We will be in trouble
if the Assistant Gwanju

31:35.560 --> 31:37.020
hears of you walking about like this.

31:37.103 --> 31:39.564
We killed everyone who could recognize me.

31:39.647 --> 31:42.191
And I'd walk about
even after I got into Jinyowon.

31:42.275 --> 31:44.402
So I should practice
walking like the blind.

31:45.528 --> 31:46.988
You should buy what you want.

31:47.071 --> 31:48.990
I gave you quite a bit of money.

31:50.533 --> 31:52.118
Still, we should return soon.

31:53.870 --> 31:54.704
But…

31:55.580 --> 31:57.832
why are you using an umbrella
instead of a cane?

31:59.834 --> 32:01.002
Don't touch it.

32:03.004 --> 32:04.380
I like this a lot.

32:14.807 --> 32:15.642
[sighs]

32:16.351 --> 32:19.228
Anyway, since you did help
prove my innocence,

32:19.312 --> 32:21.606
I hope you will be comfortable
while you are here.

32:21.689 --> 32:23.858
Does the Jang family always eat like this?

32:24.567 --> 32:26.402
Hmm, it's too greasy.

32:26.486 --> 32:28.947
[whimsical music playing]

32:29.739 --> 32:32.659
Yes, my lady.
I will prepare a different meal.

32:41.918 --> 32:43.670
Ugh, salty! It's too salty!

32:46.089 --> 32:48.049
- It is not salty.
- It is.

32:48.132 --> 32:50.343
My face gets puffy if it's salty.

32:53.054 --> 32:54.305
I understand, my lady.

32:56.516 --> 32:58.434
[exclaims] This is way too hard to eat.

32:58.518 --> 33:00.353
[groans] Oh, no.

33:01.562 --> 33:02.855
What is this thing?

33:04.107 --> 33:05.650
I think I've lost my appetite.

33:07.944 --> 33:11.197
[Mu-deok] What kind of girl is she?
Why is she acting exactly like Uk?

33:11.906 --> 33:13.199
I'm not hungry.

33:13.282 --> 33:14.784
Do you have something to drink?

33:14.867 --> 33:16.202
Like cinnamon or rice punch?

33:18.788 --> 33:19.789
[exasperated sigh]

33:22.041 --> 33:24.544
They are perfect for each other.
Why did they call it off?

33:24.627 --> 33:25.545
If they had gotten married,

33:25.628 --> 33:28.089
one of them definitely
would have died in a fight.

33:29.424 --> 33:30.550
[sighs]

33:32.927 --> 33:34.095
Mu-deok, the rice punch is--

33:34.178 --> 33:36.848
Sweet, right? And it's too cold for you?

33:36.931 --> 33:39.684
Rice punch is supposed
to be like that, okay?

33:39.767 --> 33:41.436
Why are you getting mad at me?

33:41.519 --> 33:43.062
Are you tired of serving me?

33:43.146 --> 33:46.107
[sighs] Well, you try it out then.

33:47.358 --> 33:48.443
[clears throat]

33:48.526 --> 33:50.778
It's because I get agitated
when I'm anxious.

33:50.862 --> 33:52.822
How can I relax in someone else's home?

33:52.905 --> 33:54.699
Then why don't you just go home?

33:54.782 --> 33:55.658
[sighs]

33:55.742 --> 33:58.494
No way. I'm too scared to go back.

33:58.578 --> 34:00.538
Mother is extremely angry.

34:00.621 --> 34:01.456
[sighs]

34:02.081 --> 34:05.418
Your own mother,
she must truly despise you.

34:05.501 --> 34:07.420
I was never my mother's favorite.

34:08.588 --> 34:10.757
Because I was lacking
compared to my sister.

34:12.633 --> 34:14.635
Even though she was blind,

34:14.719 --> 34:16.721
she could see energy and handle relics.

34:16.804 --> 34:19.557
Even as a child, her abilities
were on par with my mother's.

34:19.640 --> 34:21.851
Well, I've heard the Jin family members

34:21.934 --> 34:25.354
have stronger divine powers
than spell-related powers.

34:25.938 --> 34:28.107
You saw me handle Gwigu, right?

34:28.775 --> 34:29.692
It's like that.

34:30.401 --> 34:32.111
A really powerful priestess

34:32.195 --> 34:35.698
can control people's souls
and render them helpless by trapping them.

34:36.657 --> 34:38.951
- Did you say trapping a soul?
- Mm-hmm.

34:39.035 --> 34:41.079
If the priestess traps their powers,

34:41.162 --> 34:43.915
even the most powerful mage is helpless.

34:46.667 --> 34:49.003
Well, I have heard
there are shamans who can

34:49.087 --> 34:51.255
erase or change memories of a soul.

34:51.339 --> 34:53.674
A Jinyowon priestess
is in a different league.

34:54.175 --> 34:57.261
How did such an amazing girl like her
get into such an accident?

34:58.805 --> 35:00.223
Because she's amazing.

35:02.183 --> 35:04.060
She's definitely alive.

35:05.895 --> 35:07.522
We will see her again.

35:13.820 --> 35:15.196
If Bu-yeon is alive,

35:16.155 --> 35:17.573
I'm sure you will soon.

35:23.788 --> 35:24.789
[Dang-gu exhales]

35:24.872 --> 35:25.790
[Jang Uk exhales]

35:26.415 --> 35:29.377
Uncle looked into Mu-deok
to find out who she is.

35:29.961 --> 35:31.212
[Dang-gu] He asked the broker about her.

35:31.921 --> 35:32.880
Did you know that?

35:33.756 --> 35:36.926
- Yes. Mu-deok told me. Yes.
- [Dang-gu sighs]

35:37.009 --> 35:39.929
He's even more suspicious
since the soul shifter case.

35:40.513 --> 35:41.430
It makes sense.

35:41.514 --> 35:43.349
If there are actually
soul shifters in the palace,

35:43.432 --> 35:45.601
who knows if they are in Songrim, too?

35:46.686 --> 35:50.523
Park Dang-gu, why is the cast-out
successor worrying about it?

35:50.606 --> 35:52.358
I have not been cast out.

35:53.276 --> 35:55.444
- He already regrets it.
- You--

35:55.528 --> 35:58.072
You were so confident yesterday
when you left. Goodness!

35:58.656 --> 35:59.824
- [Jang Uk chuckles softly]
- [exclaims]

36:00.408 --> 36:02.034
Uk is the one that always gets kicked out.

36:02.118 --> 36:03.536
What is happening with me?

36:03.619 --> 36:05.371
It's nothing once you get used to it.

36:05.872 --> 36:09.041
But it's… miserable the first time, huh?

36:09.125 --> 36:09.959
[exhales agitatedly]

36:10.668 --> 36:12.712
Yul, you have no idea how we feel, right?

36:12.795 --> 36:13.838
What do you mean?

36:13.921 --> 36:15.006
Yul's been kicked out once, too.

36:15.089 --> 36:16.174
What? Yul?

36:16.883 --> 36:19.051
Do you not remember
that time I broke the gold-plated inkstone

36:19.135 --> 36:20.636
and we all decided to lie together?

36:25.766 --> 36:29.145
Uncle Jin is going to be so angry with me.

36:29.228 --> 36:30.605
- [whimpers]
- Let us hide it.

36:31.564 --> 36:34.233
We'll bury it in the ground
and pretend to know nothing about it.

36:34.317 --> 36:35.443
That is not the right thing.

36:36.277 --> 36:38.571
We must tell the truth
and ask for forgiveness.

36:38.654 --> 36:41.741
Then Dang-gu will get into
a lot of trouble with the leader.

36:41.824 --> 36:43.910
[sobbing]

36:44.785 --> 36:47.205
You know I cannot tell a lie.

36:48.331 --> 36:50.082
[young Jang Uk] Do not cry, Dang-gu.

36:50.958 --> 36:52.585
I'm sure there is a way.

36:54.795 --> 36:57.798
[Dang-gu] Eventually, the three of us
agreed to cover it up.

36:58.549 --> 37:00.968
But Yul became very ill afterward.

37:01.552 --> 37:04.513
I think Yul is very ill right now.

37:04.597 --> 37:05.806
I think so, too.

37:08.059 --> 37:12.063
[Heo Yeom] My goodness,
why is our Yul so sick? What is wrong?

37:12.647 --> 37:16.943
I heard he cannot eat
or sleep well lately. Huh?

37:18.694 --> 37:21.364
[Dang-gu] Yul was the golden child
who had never done anything wrong.

37:21.864 --> 37:23.824
Just how worried was he that he fell ill?

37:25.076 --> 37:28.454
So, that's why we ended up confessing
because we thought Yul would die.

37:28.537 --> 37:30.665
So we were all kicked out together.

37:30.748 --> 37:34.043
I've been kicked out so many times
that I do not remember it exactly.

37:34.126 --> 37:37.672
But if it's Yul, I doubt he was sick
because of his fear of being caught.

37:39.090 --> 37:41.801
I think it's because
he suffered so much from

37:42.468 --> 37:44.679
having to do something bad
that he already knew

37:44.762 --> 37:45.680
was completely wrong.

37:49.976 --> 37:52.144
He can't even find his way
when he is surprised?

37:52.228 --> 37:53.062
[Dang-gu laughs]

37:53.854 --> 37:56.857
He must have been so worried
and scared about doing something

37:57.608 --> 37:59.110
he knew for certain was wrong

38:00.695 --> 38:02.071
in order to protect his friends.

38:04.240 --> 38:05.199
[laughs softly]

38:07.326 --> 38:09.787
You are right. I remember it clearly.

38:11.163 --> 38:12.540
It was quite painful.

38:13.624 --> 38:15.501
The punishment you gave yourself is

38:15.584 --> 38:18.504
harsher than what
others would actually lay upon you.

38:18.587 --> 38:20.756
Is it some sort of
a heightened state of morality?

38:21.465 --> 38:23.676
[Dang-gu] Gosh, you were already
like that at that age?

38:24.385 --> 38:25.428
You sure are something.

38:26.178 --> 38:27.013
[chuckles softly]

38:27.096 --> 38:29.849
Can you imagine how I felt
burying that inkstone

38:29.932 --> 38:31.350
with my immature friends, huh?

38:32.727 --> 38:35.187
And we got caught soon after
because we didn't bury it well.

38:35.271 --> 38:36.564
- [Jang Uk] What?
- Hmm?

38:36.647 --> 38:39.358
We were caught? You said we confessed.

38:39.942 --> 38:41.527
[Seo Yul] Dang-gu is remembering it wrong.

38:42.028 --> 38:43.446
We did not confess to it.

38:44.488 --> 38:47.908
We were caught because
Sang-ho found the half-buried inkstone.

38:48.534 --> 38:49.368
Is that right?

38:50.244 --> 38:51.746
Oh, did I romanticize the memory?

38:51.829 --> 38:53.039
[scoffs]

38:53.122 --> 38:55.416
I thought this story
had an honorable ending.

38:55.499 --> 38:57.084
[laughs awkwardly]
Gosh, that's embarrassing.

38:57.168 --> 38:59.962
Embarrassing?
What are you embarrassed about?

39:00.046 --> 39:01.547
You have run away from home.

39:02.298 --> 39:05.009
Who will be the next leader
instead of Dang-gu?

39:06.260 --> 39:07.178
Will it be Sang-ho?

39:07.261 --> 39:08.637
[Jang Uk] Oh, do you think so?

39:08.721 --> 39:11.098
I should get on his good side.
I'd better get close to him.

39:11.182 --> 39:12.016
[chuckles]

39:12.099 --> 39:14.226
Hey! You two cannot discard me like this.

39:14.310 --> 39:16.228
You should take my side like back then.

39:16.312 --> 39:18.189
Come on, Uk. Uk!

39:18.272 --> 39:20.816
Having me on your side will not
be much help to you, anyway.

39:21.567 --> 39:24.612
- Hey, Yul. [chuckles]
- I'm not good with words, either.

39:25.112 --> 39:26.322
Especially about love.

39:27.448 --> 39:28.574
[laughs]

39:28.657 --> 39:29.575
[sighs]

39:33.621 --> 39:34.830
[laughs awkwardly]

39:34.914 --> 39:36.123
You're on my side.

39:42.088 --> 39:43.631
[crickets chirp]

39:54.892 --> 39:57.561
[Dang-gu] Yul, you haven't been
sleeping well these days, have you?

39:57.645 --> 40:00.189
Drink as much as you want today

40:00.731 --> 40:02.733
and get a good night's sleep.

40:04.068 --> 40:06.070
Why? You're having trouble?

40:06.695 --> 40:07.696
I'm fine.

40:07.780 --> 40:09.365
I saw you wandering around late at night.

40:09.448 --> 40:11.242
[Dang-gu]
You usually go to bed on the dot.

40:11.325 --> 40:14.870
Is it because you're concerned
about going back to Seoho Fortress?

40:16.705 --> 40:17.581
[laughs softly]

40:21.919 --> 40:24.338
[Seo Yul] I just cut down a soul shifter.

40:25.756 --> 40:27.842
Protecting this world from such monsters

40:28.884 --> 40:30.094
is our duty.

40:31.971 --> 40:33.889
Even though it is dead, it is still Gwigu.

40:34.432 --> 40:37.017
It's dangerous if its power remains.
Do not touch it.

40:44.650 --> 40:46.610
You are feigning ignorance, right?

40:50.072 --> 40:51.907
Like the time we buried the inkstone.

40:53.367 --> 40:56.370
Hey, Yul. It must be tough for you.

41:00.207 --> 41:02.209
[soft music playing]

41:14.597 --> 41:17.391
[Mu-deok] If I regain my energy
and draw this sword,

41:18.851 --> 41:22.730
will I be able to slash
anyone relentlessly like before?

41:23.731 --> 41:24.648
[sighs]

41:27.693 --> 41:29.445
That's the assassin's sword, right?

41:31.030 --> 41:32.948
Why did young master bring it back again?

41:34.492 --> 41:37.828
That sword… terrifies me a bit.

41:38.829 --> 41:40.748
It feels ominous. I don't want it here.

41:43.375 --> 41:46.337
The guests are all asleep.
So you should get to bed, too.

41:47.004 --> 41:48.631
Maybe we need to have a charm written.

41:49.465 --> 41:50.299
[sighs]

41:58.933 --> 42:00.059
Terrifying…

42:03.229 --> 42:04.271
and ominous.

42:10.528 --> 42:12.571
[ominous music playing]

42:27.962 --> 42:28.796
[chuckles softly]

42:34.802 --> 42:36.887
[Go Won] Eunuch Kim
who caused trouble at Cheonbugwan,

42:36.971 --> 42:38.722
is not beside the Queen today, either.

42:39.682 --> 42:41.058
Did you look into it?

42:41.141 --> 42:44.395
They say he's ill and is resting, sire,
but no one knows where he is.

42:46.188 --> 42:48.399
Find out as much as you can about him.

42:48.482 --> 42:49.984
Find out when he came to the palace,

42:50.067 --> 42:53.112
when he started serving the Queen,
and if there is anything odd about him.

42:53.946 --> 42:55.197
Be discrete, Eunuch Oh.

42:56.073 --> 42:56.991
Yes, Your Highness.

43:03.038 --> 43:06.500
Do you remember what Eunuch Kim said
when we saw him back there at Cheonbugwan?

43:08.752 --> 43:10.921
[Eunuch Kim] Did that wench Shaman Choi

43:11.589 --> 43:13.507
order you to kill me?

43:14.091 --> 43:15.801
So, Shaman Choi…

43:15.884 --> 43:18.971
she must be superior to Jin Mu
to have ordered him.

43:20.014 --> 43:21.307
It must be the Queen.

43:21.807 --> 43:24.518
Just as Mu-deok's true identity is Naksu,

43:24.602 --> 43:26.061
could the true identity of the Queen…

43:27.313 --> 43:29.023
really be Shaman Choi?

43:29.106 --> 43:29.982
You might be right.

43:31.400 --> 43:34.278
If the Queen… is a soul shifter.

43:35.362 --> 43:39.325
There was no evidence to suspect
Her Highness the Queen is a soul shifter.

43:39.408 --> 43:42.411
I checked her core of energy
as I was examining her,

43:42.494 --> 43:45.414
but she was a normal person
without notable energy.

43:47.708 --> 43:51.920
She could have appeared that way
if she had the ice stone with her.

43:52.630 --> 43:53.881
Hmm.

43:53.964 --> 43:57.676
The Queen is really the younger sister
of General Seo, isn't that right?

43:57.760 --> 43:59.178
She's Yul's aunt.

43:59.261 --> 44:02.848
She's not related to the Heo family,
but she is a member of the Seo family.

44:02.931 --> 44:04.433
If her soul is shifted,

44:05.392 --> 44:09.229
the soul in the Queen's body now
is someone else.

44:09.313 --> 44:12.483
Then, does that mean
the soul of the Queen is dead?

44:13.067 --> 44:14.526
[Yun-ok] That's not possible.

44:14.610 --> 44:18.238
Each member of the Seo Family
has a personal Lantern of Life, you see.

44:19.198 --> 44:22.743
Because they guard the Seoho Fortress
near the border and go to battle often,

44:22.826 --> 44:26.664
they each have a lantern that is lit
by the energy of their soul

44:26.747 --> 44:28.415
so they know who is alive and dead.

44:29.583 --> 44:31.794
If the Queen had passed away,

44:32.294 --> 44:35.464
they would know immediately
because her lantern would have gone out.

44:36.256 --> 44:38.926
That's right, the Lantern of Life.

44:39.009 --> 44:43.097
They would have moved her soul
and kept it alive.

44:44.807 --> 44:47.226
[Jin]
Just like Master Kang of Daegangtongun

44:48.352 --> 44:50.312
who is lying in Sejukwon right now.

44:52.690 --> 44:57.069
Then, are you certain
that the Queen is really a soul shifter?

44:58.654 --> 45:00.322
If we can know that for sure,

45:01.323 --> 45:04.827
that would mean
we found Jin Mu's greatest weakness.

45:07.996 --> 45:10.207
[Queen] Songrim is suspicious of me.

45:10.290 --> 45:13.252
They will try to prove
that the Queen's a soul shifter.

45:13.335 --> 45:14.878
What is there to worry about?

45:15.921 --> 45:19.049
We already have a body here
for you to transfer your soul.

45:20.384 --> 45:22.428
[eerie music playing]

45:24.430 --> 45:28.350
[Queen] Getting that body into Jinyowon
should not be a problem, right?

45:29.601 --> 45:31.395
I will bring her to Jinyowon today.

45:31.979 --> 45:34.231
If everything goes according to plan,

45:34.815 --> 45:37.359
Jinyowon will finally
get their lost daughter back,

45:38.026 --> 45:40.529
and there will soon be
a funeral at the palace.

45:42.573 --> 45:45.784
Because Her Majesty,
the Queen will have passed away.

45:48.495 --> 45:53.125
What should we do
with my body the Queen's soul is in?

45:53.208 --> 45:54.209
[sniggers]

45:55.252 --> 45:58.005
We should take care of it
since we no longer need it alive.

46:01.425 --> 46:03.427
[ominous music playing]

46:14.188 --> 46:15.022
[door opens]

46:16.064 --> 46:16.940
[door closes]

46:41.006 --> 46:43.759
Your Highness, I've come here today
in place of Eunuch Kim.

46:52.601 --> 46:53.727
It's such a pity.

46:54.686 --> 46:58.565
I really think it would be
better for you to let go of your mind.

46:58.649 --> 46:59.775
[moaning softly]

47:16.875 --> 47:17.709
[sighs]

47:20.629 --> 47:22.130
Huh, this must be Gaema Village.

47:23.131 --> 47:24.800
[Ju-wol] You are looking for a shaman?

47:25.300 --> 47:26.176
Mm-hmm.

47:27.135 --> 47:29.012
Then try going to Gaema Village.

47:29.805 --> 47:32.516
All kinds of shamans gather there
all the time.

47:33.517 --> 47:36.103
And I happen to be on good terms
with the oldest of them all.

47:36.687 --> 47:39.481
If you are looking for someone,
you will find him there.

47:42.901 --> 47:44.278
[woman]
Come on, Fire Priestess is really--

47:44.361 --> 47:46.405
- [man] No, thank you.
- Oh, goodness.

47:46.488 --> 47:48.115
- Uh, excuse me.
- [sighs]

47:48.198 --> 47:50.492
Do you know where Shaman Bong's house is?

47:50.576 --> 47:54.246
Shaman Bong? Gosh!
He doesn't have powers anymore.

47:54.329 --> 47:55.998
You should go to
the Fire Priestess instead.

47:56.081 --> 47:58.792
- I will take you there.
- No, I-- I'm looking for Shaman Bong.

47:58.875 --> 48:02.546
- [woman] I told you, he is not good.
- No, it has to be Shaman Bong. I'm sorry.

48:02.629 --> 48:03.755
- [woman exhales]
- [Jang Uk] Thank you.

48:16.059 --> 48:17.853
Ugh, where am I?

48:18.562 --> 48:20.647
All of the streets look the same to me.

48:20.731 --> 48:21.648
Ugh!

48:24.401 --> 48:27.362
[man] This is ridiculous! When did I say
I wanted to see the Fire Priestess?

48:27.446 --> 48:31.158
[woman] But if you had your fortune read,
you still have to pay, sir!

48:31.241 --> 48:33.118
- [Go Won] Oh? Let go!
- Gosh! Oh…

48:33.201 --> 48:35.662
[Go Won] She did not get
a single thing right. Why should I pay?

48:40.584 --> 48:41.752
[woman] Ah!

48:41.835 --> 48:43.629
Did you go and see Shaman Bong?

48:43.712 --> 48:44.963
Not very good, is he?

48:45.047 --> 48:48.050
The Fire Priestess
is the real deal, right?

48:48.133 --> 48:49.760
Fire Priestess! What Fire Priestess?

48:49.843 --> 48:50.927
[woman] Uh, come on.

48:51.011 --> 48:52.054
[woman laughs awkwardly]

48:53.930 --> 48:54.765
[Go Won] Enough!

48:56.141 --> 48:58.727
[Jang Uk] Did you come
to have your fortune read?

48:58.810 --> 49:00.812
[Go Won] What about you?
Are you here for an exorcism?

49:02.022 --> 49:04.691
What did the Fire Priestess say
to make you so angry?

49:05.442 --> 49:08.904
She said I have no luck in government
and that I should get into business

49:08.987 --> 49:10.947
- when I'm the Crown Prince.
- [clicks tongue]

49:11.823 --> 49:13.533
What did Shaman Bong say to you?

49:13.617 --> 49:15.952
I am on my way to see him.
I have many questions for him.

49:18.872 --> 49:19.790
Jang Uk.

49:23.043 --> 49:25.170
Are you perhaps also here for Eunuch Kim?

49:28.715 --> 49:30.342
Why are you looking for him here?

49:34.096 --> 49:37.391
Since that day at Cheonbugwan,
he has disappeared from the palace.

49:38.225 --> 49:40.185
His traces led me to this place.

49:40.268 --> 49:43.605
Wait, so you came all the way here
alone without any guards?

49:45.440 --> 49:47.234
Because I did not want anyone to notice

49:48.193 --> 49:49.820
that I am suspicious of him.

49:53.073 --> 49:54.991
So you are suspicious because Eunuch Kim

49:56.076 --> 49:58.954
is a soul shifter
and the Queen is trying to cover it up?

50:01.039 --> 50:01.957
Right.

50:03.166 --> 50:04.960
Why are you here?
What are you looking for?

50:05.794 --> 50:08.630
I think there are overlaps
in what we are looking for.

50:08.714 --> 50:10.632
Shall we exchange information?

50:10.716 --> 50:12.718
Share one piece of information each?

50:12.801 --> 50:14.803
Fine. You go first then.

50:14.886 --> 50:16.805
No way. Come on now. If I tell you first,

50:16.888 --> 50:19.599
you'll say, "I am the Crown Prince,"
and not bother to tell me yours.

50:19.683 --> 50:20.642
You don't know that for sure.

50:22.310 --> 50:23.562
[clears throat] All right. Fine.

50:25.188 --> 50:28.400
I was searching for Eunuch Kim,
and I found something strange.

50:28.900 --> 50:31.445
They say that he left the palace
every month to go somewhere.

50:32.320 --> 50:34.281
And that is this place, Gaema Village.

50:35.365 --> 50:37.534
The person I'm looking for is Shaman Choi.

50:38.118 --> 50:39.035
Shaman who?

50:39.119 --> 50:41.580
That is for the next exchange.
So, goodbye then.

50:42.414 --> 50:43.623
Hey, hey, hey. Wait. Hold on.

50:44.708 --> 50:47.836
What can I get from "I'm looking for
Shaman Choi," with no context?

50:47.919 --> 50:49.671
I do not know much about it, either.

50:52.507 --> 50:55.510
- Why are you following me now?
- [Go Won] To meet Shaman Bong.

50:55.594 --> 50:57.220
We don't have to go together
at the same time.

50:57.304 --> 51:00.640
I can just go afterward
and get him to tell me what he told you.

51:01.308 --> 51:02.434
Because I'm the Crown Prince.

51:03.894 --> 51:05.437
- Hmm.
- [sighs]

51:07.731 --> 51:09.483
[Jang Uk]
I do not know where he is, either.

51:09.566 --> 51:10.901
[Go Won] I know you do.

51:10.984 --> 51:12.319
[Jang Uk] I really have no idea.

51:15.363 --> 51:20.410
I have met with both of your families
on the behalf of you two.

51:20.494 --> 51:21.787
What did she say?

51:22.496 --> 51:24.748
Is she still very angry at me?

51:25.624 --> 51:27.667
Is my uncle really going to cast me out?

51:28.960 --> 51:31.505
They said they will be able
to forgive you both

51:31.588 --> 51:33.215
if you can submit a signed letter.

51:33.298 --> 51:36.134
An official letter swearing
never to see each other again.

51:39.513 --> 51:40.347
Here.

51:42.682 --> 51:44.059
Everything is already written,

51:44.142 --> 51:46.353
so, all you have to do is sign each copy

51:46.436 --> 51:47.479
so you can go home.

51:48.772 --> 51:50.524
You can discuss
before making your decision.

51:51.358 --> 51:56.530
As for me, I am willing to provide
food and shelter for a while

51:56.613 --> 51:58.406
if you insist on staying together.

51:58.490 --> 51:59.950
Please, excuse me.

52:10.752 --> 52:11.628
Cho-yeon…

52:17.008 --> 52:18.009
to tell you the truth…

52:21.513 --> 52:23.265
I slightly regretted it.

52:26.017 --> 52:28.103
I was also scared that I may have acted…

52:30.605 --> 52:32.065
rather impulsively.

52:35.944 --> 52:36.820
But…

52:37.821 --> 52:39.823
[soft music playing]

52:40.323 --> 52:41.449
[breathes shakily]

52:43.451 --> 52:45.287
…when I think of never seeing you again…

52:48.707 --> 52:50.458
I don't care about anything else.

52:52.502 --> 52:54.212
I cannot sign this letter.

52:54.296 --> 52:55.964
I cannot live without seeing you.

52:58.258 --> 53:00.385
JIN CHO-YEON OF JINYOWON SWEARS NEVER
TO SEE PARK DANG-GU OF SONGRIM AGAIN

53:01.261 --> 53:03.430
I was also annoyed at first.

53:06.474 --> 53:08.184
But I want to keep seeing you.

53:19.654 --> 53:21.656
[soft music continues playing]

53:30.040 --> 53:31.124
[laughs softly]

53:44.679 --> 53:46.348
The negotiation is off.

53:46.848 --> 53:49.517
Mu-deok, please, go set the table now.

53:50.310 --> 53:52.312
[whimsical music playing]

53:52.812 --> 53:53.772
[sighs]

53:56.066 --> 53:57.108
[Dang-gu] Have some fish.

54:00.445 --> 54:01.279
[chuckles]

54:02.739 --> 54:03.573
Here.

54:04.324 --> 54:05.367
Have some meat as well.

54:17.963 --> 54:22.050
Are you two really
going to be staying here?

54:22.133 --> 54:22.968
Mm-hmm.

54:23.468 --> 54:26.846
We are both going to go home
and bring our belongings here, too.

54:26.930 --> 54:30.350
Wait! So you intend
to live here full-time?

54:32.102 --> 54:34.020
[laughs awkwardly] It's not like that,

54:34.729 --> 54:36.398
but we at least need a change of clothes.

54:36.481 --> 54:37.899
Mu-deok, could you go
with Cho-yeon, please,

54:37.983 --> 54:39.401
and help her carry all her luggage back?

54:39.484 --> 54:40.318
[chuckles]

54:43.780 --> 54:44.906
[sighs]

54:46.825 --> 54:47.909
[pants]

54:50.203 --> 54:51.913
Did you throw away the paper
that was here?

54:52.497 --> 54:53.331
I was about to.

54:53.415 --> 54:54.582
[gasps]

55:00.630 --> 55:01.548
JIN CHO-YEON OF JINYOWON SWEARS NEVER
TO SEE PARK DANG-GU OF SONGRIM AGAIN

55:01.631 --> 55:03.258
[Cho-yeon] I need to think it over again.

55:04.426 --> 55:07.679
If I pack up my things and leave,
I might really get kicked out.

55:09.764 --> 55:11.099
Did you get hurt?

55:13.351 --> 55:14.269
Does it hurt?

55:15.103 --> 55:16.479
Of course, it does.

55:20.275 --> 55:21.151
[Cho-yeon] Oh.

55:21.860 --> 55:22.819
You have a scar.

55:22.902 --> 55:24.446
How did you get that?

55:25.196 --> 55:26.031
I don't know.

55:26.656 --> 55:28.616
It was when I was young. I don't remember.

55:29.617 --> 55:31.578
That's a scar from a laceration.

55:31.661 --> 55:34.831
My sister had one
in the same place because of me.

55:36.124 --> 55:38.793
She fell exactly like you did just now.

55:46.843 --> 55:49.137
A scar has formed on the cut.

55:53.141 --> 55:54.184
Oh.

55:54.267 --> 55:55.602
This will definitely do.

55:57.604 --> 56:00.690
I will try to do my best, Father.

56:03.318 --> 56:05.070
Don't call me that unless it's needed.

56:06.446 --> 56:07.489
It disgusts me.

56:16.706 --> 56:17.624
[scoffs]

56:18.458 --> 56:19.918
Did he have to be so rude about it?

56:20.627 --> 56:23.129
Why did he throw away
such a beautiful silk handkerchief?

56:25.381 --> 56:26.382
Wait.

56:34.516 --> 56:36.810
It has the same design as Mu-deok's.

56:41.356 --> 56:43.608
- Did the lord from Jinyowon leave?
- Yes.

56:43.691 --> 56:44.526
[So-i clears throat]

56:46.778 --> 56:48.279
What is this design?

56:48.363 --> 56:51.825
It is the crest of the Jin family
of Jinyowon, which you will join soon.

56:51.908 --> 56:53.993
You will go there today. Get ready.

56:54.702 --> 56:55.537
Right.

56:58.623 --> 57:00.166
Is that what this was?

57:00.250 --> 57:02.252
[epic music playing]

57:09.008 --> 57:10.885
Why would Mu-deok have something

57:11.719 --> 57:13.763
with the crest of Jinyowon on it?

57:21.604 --> 57:24.107
You have to get my things
without my mother finding out.

57:24.190 --> 57:25.024
Follow me.

57:25.608 --> 57:26.443
[sighs]

57:26.526 --> 57:28.862
I wish she would just stay
since we are already at her house.

57:33.074 --> 57:35.285
[yelling]

57:37.203 --> 57:40.123
How can we believe this guy?
He seems like a hack.

57:40.957 --> 57:43.293
Well, let's see. I heard
that he is something.

57:43.376 --> 57:47.213
You are both piping hot.
You have shared something.

57:47.881 --> 57:48.965
Are you two lovers?

57:49.048 --> 57:51.092
[whimsical music playing]

57:51.176 --> 57:52.093
[both groan in disgust]

57:52.719 --> 57:54.637
[exclaims] Ah.

57:54.721 --> 57:57.932
It is my business policy
never to breach confidentiality.

57:58.016 --> 57:59.601
So you can rest assured.

57:59.684 --> 58:04.522
But the two of you have already shared
something very meaningful, right?

58:06.024 --> 58:06.900
He is good.

58:08.359 --> 58:09.194
Ugh.

58:11.863 --> 58:15.116
I heard you are the one who has been
living in Gaema Village the longest.

58:15.200 --> 58:16.701
Do you happen to know Shaman Choi?

58:19.996 --> 58:21.247
Shaman Choi, you say?

58:21.331 --> 58:24.250
Are you mages patrolling
the town for sorcery?

58:25.877 --> 58:27.545
[Jang Uk laughs awkwardly]

58:27.629 --> 58:30.048
Oh, no. It's nothing like that. No!

58:30.131 --> 58:33.426
I only wanted to find her
because I heard she was good.

58:36.554 --> 58:38.556
[Shaman Bong] Oh, yes, she was.

58:39.140 --> 58:40.934
Over 20 years ago.

58:41.017 --> 58:43.061
[instrument clinking]

58:47.941 --> 58:49.817
Shaman Choi was famous

58:49.901 --> 58:53.404
for her sorcery that put hexes on people.

58:54.447 --> 58:56.407
Then one day, she got caught

58:56.491 --> 59:00.370
by Cheonbugwan mages
who were cracking down on sorcery.

59:01.287 --> 59:02.830
But she jumped into a fire.

59:04.958 --> 59:08.419
Some say she died in that fire.

59:09.295 --> 59:13.883
And others say she was burnt badly
but survived and ran away.

59:13.967 --> 59:14.926
That was when

59:15.009 --> 59:17.887
your father Jang Gang was the Gwanju
of Cheonbugwan, was it not?

59:20.807 --> 59:23.935
If Shaman Choi was hunted
by the mages of Cheonbugwan back then,

59:25.061 --> 59:27.355
are you seeking her because
she bears a grudge against your father?

59:27.438 --> 59:29.774
I do not even remember
what my father looks like.

59:30.358 --> 59:32.819
So how can I know
who bears a grudge against him?

59:36.197 --> 59:39.242
PARK DANG-GU OF SONGRIM SWEARS NEVER
TO SEE JIN CHO-YEON OF JINYOWON AGAIN

59:41.369 --> 59:43.621
Dang-gu, you did not sign the paper.

59:43.705 --> 59:45.832
I thought about signing the paper
and coming back home…

59:47.166 --> 59:49.252
but then I thought
that would just be lying.

59:49.335 --> 59:51.296
Because I cannot live without seeing her.

59:52.797 --> 59:53.673
[Dang-gu sighs]

59:54.591 --> 59:56.801
These feelings did not blossom overnight.

59:57.927 --> 01:00:01.014
I was in love with her, sir,
for a really long time, you know.

01:00:01.097 --> 01:00:03.683
But I could not express it
and could only take her hand just now.

01:00:03.766 --> 01:00:05.184
So don't call us childish,

01:00:05.268 --> 01:00:07.812
and please, give us a chance, Uncle.

01:00:07.895 --> 01:00:10.189
Take your bundle of belongings

01:00:10.273 --> 01:00:11.899
and go to Uk's home now.

01:00:11.983 --> 01:00:12.817
[breathes shakily]

01:00:12.900 --> 01:00:14.611
- Uncle, please, don't--
- There is…

01:00:15.612 --> 01:00:17.071
something you must do there.

01:00:26.789 --> 01:00:28.708
If this person comes to his house,

01:00:28.791 --> 01:00:30.460
let me know immediately.

01:00:30.543 --> 01:00:32.587
Who is… who is this?

01:00:33.755 --> 01:00:35.590
Cheonbugwan's Gwanju, Jang Gang.

01:00:36.341 --> 01:00:37.592
He is Uk's father.

01:00:41.220 --> 01:00:42.221
If he comes…

01:00:44.766 --> 01:00:45.725
let me know…

01:00:47.101 --> 01:00:47.977
right away.

01:00:50.938 --> 01:00:52.815
[Shaman Bong] Oh, wait, I forgot.

01:00:52.899 --> 01:00:56.444
Shaman Choi actually had
a younger brother.

01:00:57.403 --> 01:01:00.198
Do you perhaps know
where we might find him?

01:01:00.281 --> 01:01:04.285
I have not seen him in Gaema Village
since the incident, either.

01:01:04.994 --> 01:01:08.331
But there used to be a rumor going around

01:01:08.414 --> 01:01:10.875
that he married a woman
from a powerful family.

01:01:11.584 --> 01:01:13.586
[suspenseful music playing]

01:01:35.608 --> 01:01:38.611
I heard the girl you're bringing
this time is most likely her.

01:01:39.487 --> 01:01:41.322
Why is she wearing those rags, though?

01:01:41.406 --> 01:01:43.866
She almost drowned
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho once.

01:01:43.950 --> 01:01:46.619
She was barely alive
when the fishermen rescued her.

01:01:47.537 --> 01:01:51.207
Perhaps having almost died
has caused her to lose all her memories,

01:01:51.290 --> 01:01:54.043
but she can sense things around her
as though she can really see,

01:01:54.836 --> 01:01:56.295
even though she is blind.

01:01:57.839 --> 01:01:59.882
[dramatic music playing]

01:02:16.816 --> 01:02:17.692
[gasps]

01:02:19.318 --> 01:02:22.321
You really do have the birthmark here.

01:02:24.532 --> 01:02:25.867
[breathes heavily]

01:02:29.370 --> 01:02:30.580
[gasps]

01:02:31.289 --> 01:02:33.040
And you have a scar in the same place.

01:02:34.375 --> 01:02:37.587
So that was why
he said that you are likely

01:02:38.796 --> 01:02:39.714
to be Bu-yeon.

01:02:39.797 --> 01:02:40.631
However,

01:02:41.507 --> 01:02:42.842
it could still be a coincidence.

01:02:42.925 --> 01:02:45.595
So why not give her the test
with the surest and only method?

01:02:52.518 --> 01:02:54.687
Let's go and see if you can open…

01:02:56.314 --> 01:02:57.356
Jinyowon.

01:03:07.784 --> 01:03:09.452
[Cho-yeon]
The Cheonbugwan people are here again.

01:03:09.952 --> 01:03:12.246
They must have brought
another girl to see if she is Bu-yeon.

01:03:16.417 --> 01:03:18.419
[suspenseful music playing]

01:03:22.298 --> 01:03:25.176
[Jin Mu] Since you have
Jin Cho-yeon's blood in your body,

01:03:25.802 --> 01:03:28.346
you should be able to
move the doors of Jinyowon.

01:03:30.306 --> 01:03:32.892
All you have to do is
move the doors even a little bit.

01:03:33.476 --> 01:03:34.685
That should be enough.

01:03:35.269 --> 01:03:37.522
[suspenseful music continues playing]

01:03:45.196 --> 01:03:47.240
Dozens have already been here before,

01:03:48.407 --> 01:03:50.451
but none of the girls
could open that door.

01:03:56.541 --> 01:03:58.000
[breathes shakily]

01:03:59.877 --> 01:04:01.420
[loud ringing]

01:04:09.470 --> 01:04:11.472
[celestial music playing]

01:04:25.027 --> 01:04:25.862
[gasps]

01:04:33.286 --> 01:04:34.203
Oh, Bu-yeon!

01:04:34.287 --> 01:04:35.663
[breathes deeply]

01:04:35.746 --> 01:04:36.747
Bu-yeon!

01:04:40.376 --> 01:04:41.419
[Mu-deok] It is happening again.

01:04:41.919 --> 01:04:44.463
Why does this happens
every time I come to Jinyowon?

01:05:00.313 --> 01:05:01.856
If it was 20 years ago,

01:05:02.398 --> 01:05:04.525
it was when Jin Mu
was your father's pupil.

01:05:06.360 --> 01:05:08.195
Jin Mu may know something.
Should I ask him?

01:05:08.738 --> 01:05:09.864
Absolutely not.

01:05:10.531 --> 01:05:14.201
Please keep what you heard today
just between you and me, please.

01:05:15.953 --> 01:05:19.081
Well, what we learned today
doesn't seem important, but I will.

01:05:22.793 --> 01:05:26.047
Your Highness, you said
you came here alone, did you not?

01:05:26.130 --> 01:05:27.089
I did.

01:05:27.173 --> 01:05:30.301
But it seems like someone has been
following us for a while now, right?

01:05:34.096 --> 01:05:37.266
Shall we split up here, then?
To see who they are following?

01:05:38.225 --> 01:05:39.060
Mm.

01:05:39.936 --> 01:05:41.938
[ominous music playing]

01:06:00.581 --> 01:06:03.209
[breathes shakily]

01:06:06.504 --> 01:06:07.338
[laughs]

01:06:17.473 --> 01:06:18.599
[Cho-yeon] Mother!

01:06:18.683 --> 01:06:20.685
[tense music playing]

01:06:34.532 --> 01:06:36.534
[tense music continues playing]

01:07:00.683 --> 01:07:02.685
Who are you and why are you following me?

01:07:05.730 --> 01:07:06.647
Who are you?

01:07:10.067 --> 01:07:11.193
Tell me.

01:07:11.277 --> 01:07:13.279
[suspenseful music continues playing]

01:07:33.007 --> 01:07:35.009
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the Garden playing]

01:08:04.205 --> 01:08:06.957
The Jin Bu-yeon
that Jin Mu has found is really So-i.

01:08:07.041 --> 01:08:08.250
[So-i] Why is it in this room though?

01:08:08.334 --> 01:08:09.752
Mu-deok is the real daughter.

01:08:09.835 --> 01:08:11.796
What will become of me
if she finds that out?

01:08:11.879 --> 01:08:13.214
Jin Mu has a card in his hand

01:08:13.297 --> 01:08:15.841
so big that even if
Jin Ho-gyeong finds out,

01:08:15.925 --> 01:08:17.134
she then can do nothing.

01:08:17.718 --> 01:08:18.761
[Ho-gyeong] What do you want?

01:08:18.844 --> 01:08:21.097
You, the head of Jinyowon,
must fight Songrim

01:08:21.180 --> 01:08:23.349
so that we can all protect the ice stone.

01:08:23.432 --> 01:08:24.600
[all yell]

01:08:24.683 --> 01:08:26.602
[Jin] Everyone, please, settle down!

01:08:26.685 --> 01:08:29.730
[Go Won] Do you mean you wish to become
a hero with the fate of the King's Star

01:08:29.814 --> 01:08:31.482
by destroying every ice stone then?

01:08:31.565 --> 01:08:32.858
[Master Kang] Is Seo Yul among them?

01:08:32.942 --> 01:08:35.194
I'm going to kill him first. [grunts]

01:08:35.277 --> 01:08:36.112
[So-i] Young Master!

01:08:36.195 --> 01:08:37.905
[So-i screams]

01:08:37.988 --> 01:08:38.948
[Yeol] There's a soul shifter.

01:08:39.031 --> 01:08:40.324
[Beom] Uk is going to die!

01:08:40.407 --> 01:08:42.409
[Mu-deok] Jang Uk, my pupil…
